    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Solomoni kūlomba masala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Daūdi akabiza na nguzu ū mu būtemi bokwe, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe walī hamò nang'hwe; h'ūyo akang'winha kūhangama no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūhooya na a Baisilaeli a bose, baalīho a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale igana igana; baalīho na a balamuji, na a batongeeji a bose, a bataale ba ndūgū ja mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni nī libità lya banhū ī lyose būja Gibeoni kwipandī lya higūlya; nguno ī liheema lya kwibilingīla lya ng'wa Mulungu lyalī kwenūko, īlo Musa ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA walī walībeeja aho bataalī kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Daūdi walī wamala kūlyenha ī lisandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA kūfuma ī Kiliati-yalimu; ūlītūūla ū ng'wipandī īlo walī walībeegeja; nguno walī walīkomela iheema mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ng'walīlo gwa shaba ūyo gwalī gwabeejiwa na Bezaleli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Uuli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Huuli gwalī gūtaalī Gibeoni kū būtongi w'ipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA; na lūūlū ū Solomoni nī libità ī lyose būja koi kūjūnomba ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūja a ha ng'walīlo gwa shaba ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, ūfunya mitugo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mitugo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, īkī ū mhayo “mitugo” gūtīmo ū mu shandīkwa ī shaho na kale, alīyo īmanīīkile gīkī ū Solomono akafunya mitugo; na lūūlū gongejiagwa kūlwa kūgunanha basomi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shihūmbī shimò kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemvwa a ha ng'walīlo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū Mulungu ūng'wilongela ū Solomoni ūng'wīla, “Lombaga shose shose īsho ūtogilwe nakwinhe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūnshokeja ū Mulungu, “Ū baba ū Daūdi wang'olekegije wiza būtaale no, hūna ū nene ūnīīta kūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū SEEBA Mulungu, shikīlījaga ū kwisagīja kwako ū kūlī baba ū Daūdi, nguno wanīītile kūbiza ntemi wa banhū bingī gītī lūbuubuu lwa hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninhage masala na witegeleja, nadūle ū kūbatongeela a banhū benaba; nguno nani ūyo adūgije kūlīsuga ī lihanga lya banhū bako ī litaale lyenīlī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mulungu ūng'wīla, “Īkī ī ng'hūmbū ja ng'holò yako jilī ha mhayo gwenūyū, waleka kūlomba būsabi, sabo ningī, ikūjo, nūūlū gīkī banishi bako bache; nūūlū ūtalombile myaka mingī ya būlamu, alīyo walomba ūpandīke masala na witegeleja ūmane ū kūbasuga a banhū bane abo nakwītile kūbiza ntemi wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ng'hana ūkūpandīka ū witegeleja nū būdeeba. Nū būsabi nakūkwinha, pyī nī sabo ningī, nī likūjo; ūkūpandīka ūmo ataalī kūpandīkīla ntemi ūngī ose ose, na atalabiza ho ūngī wa kūbiza gītī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni wīnga ū kū būtongi w'iheema lya kwibilingīla ū kwipandī lyeelya ī Gibeoni, ūja Yelusalemu. Ūbasuga a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni walī wakumingīja magogoteni mingī ga falasa, hamò na badamhīji ba falasa bingī no; walī na magogoteni shihūmbī shimò na magana anè, na falasa shihūmbī ikūmi na shibīlī; ī shose shenīshi walī ashibīkile mu mizengo īyo walī wazenga kūlwa magogoteni ga būlūgū; na shingī wikalaga nasho ū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū ntemi walī wajikwīja no ī feza ū mu Yelusalemu, jaali gītī mawe dūhū, nī mitī ya mibanga yalī mingī no, gītī mipumbula",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mipumbula:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū būlenganīja būlī ha mitī īyo ītatūmamīlagwa kūbeeja shikolo shitengeke, īyo īkabizaga mingī ū kū mapandī ayo īkazwaga; nū mu 9:27.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " īyo īkazwaga mu matūmbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī falasa ja ng'wa Solomoni jalagījiagwa kūfuma Misili na Kū; a bachooji ba sabo ba ng'wikūlū bajaga Kū baakajigūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A magogoteni ayo gagūlagwa būlī lyene īlo balīgūlaga na kūlyenha, lyabasojaga shekeeli ja feza ja būdito wa kilo mpungatī, ī falasa būlī yene yabasojaga shekeeli ja feza ja būdito wa kūkīla a ha kilo īmò na nusu. Nabo babajingījaga ī shikolo shenīsho pye a batemi ba Bahītī na a Baalamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
